  "notes": "{弾|ひ}く is used for playing stringed and keyboard instruments where keys or strings are pressed/plucked.\n\nAPPLIES TO:\n- ピアノ: piano\n- ギター: guitar\n- バイオリン: violin\n- {三味線|しゃみせん}: shamisen\n\nINSTRUMENT VERB DISTINCTIONS:\n- {弾|ひ}く: stringed/keyboard (piano, guitar)\n- {吹|ふ}く: wind instruments (flute, trumpet)\n- {叩|たた}く/{打|う}つ: percussion (drums)\n- {演奏|えんそう}する: to perform (any instrument, formal)\n\nNOTE:\nDo not confuse with other verbs read as ひく:\n- {引|ひ}く: to pull\n- {惹|ひ}く: to attract",
